/// Register8 marker trait — see `silica_device_actor_specification.md` §4.8.
///
/// Closed: its one implementation is `uint8`. The postfix marker `expr impl Register8 {}` on a
/// `peek` call or a `poke` value asserts that the access is 8 bits wide and that `expr` has type
/// `uint8`; it never establishes an implementation.

export trait Register8;
impl uint8;
